    intro: "Palmetto Bay homeowners expect quality, and tile work in this area reflects that. We install premium porcelain, natural stone, and large format tile in Palmetto Bay homes that demand a high-end finish. Whether it is a full-home floor installation or a custom master shower, we bring the precision these projects require. Many Palmetto Bay homes have larger rooms and open floor plans that look best with large format tiles. 24x24 or even 24x48 rectified porcelain gives these spaces a seamless, modern feel with minimal grout lines. We have the tools to cut these big tiles clean and set them perfectly flat. Natural stone is popular in Palmetto Bay. Marble, travertine, and slate show up in entryways, bathrooms, and outdoor areas. Working with natural stone requires different techniques than ceramic or porcelain. We seal the stone before grouting to prevent staining, use color-matched grout, and apply a final sealant for protection. Bathroom tile in Palmetto Bay often involves custom shower designs with bench seats, multiple niches, and full floor-to-ceiling tile. We build these showers with proper waterproofing systems and attention to every detail. Kitchen backsplashes here range from marble slabs to intricate mosaic patterns. We work with your designer or help you pick materials that fit the space. Palmetto Bay tile work is not a place to cut corners, and we never do.",
